    {
      "id": "claim_21d6fba2671c4b75b2bd0a277ae4b2d9",
      "statement": "The catalog CI templates are wiring only: the GitHub workflow's check job runs one `harness-catalog ci check` line and the evals job one `harness-catalog ci evals --agent` line (matrix from the JSON repository variable HARNESS_EVALS_AGENTS), and the GitLab template does the same via a hidden credentials job, so the logic lives in the pinned CLI rather than in per-repository YAML that init never rewrites.",
