    {
      "id": "claim_b9f1728e106b4882b693d10d5b8335f3",
      "statement": "ci.base_commit selects the base for history checks fail-closed: a GitHub pull request uses merge-base with origin/<base ref> or errors; a push uses the first of CI_MERGE_REQUEST_DIFF_BASE_SHA, the event payload's before, or CI_COMMIT_BEFORE_SHA, mapping a zero SHA to the empty tree and fetching an unknown SHA from origin once before refusing; with a CI marker present and no candidate it raises CIError, and only a local run falls back to HEAD~1 or HEAD.",
      "evidence": [
