      "statement": "ci evals exits 1 when the harness's credentials (per the Harbor agent variable table) or the three Langfuse variables are missing, exits 2 when the base or diff cannot be determined, and otherwise runs two harbor jobs per changed skill with an evals/ directory — with --skill and as a baseline — pinned to harbor 0.24.0 and the harbor-langfuse plugin at the CLI's own tag, continuing after failures and exiting 1 if any failed.",
